      "body": "## Motivation\n\n`check-pr-test-health` runs before every PR test shard to skip it when a sibling job has already failed. On #41916, its jobs-list request got a transient **HTTP 502** from GitHub, and `actions/github-script` made **zero retries**, so the shard failed before running any tests and `pr-test-finish` failed the PR.\n\n- Failed shard: [`base-c-test-8-gpu-h20 (1)`](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39695800431/job/119998764363) (run 39695800431, attempt 3)\n- Log: `retries: 0` → `RequestError [HttpError]: Server Error … status: 502` → `##[error]Unhandled error`\n- Not a quota problem: `x-ratelimit-remaining: 13235`\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Set `retries: 3` on the `actions/github-script` step. Its built-in Octokit retry handles 5xx responses with backoff.\n- If listing the run's jobs still fails after the retries, log a clear warning and skip the fail-fast check, so the shard runs its tests:\n  ```\n  [health-check] SKIP: could not list this run's jobs after 3 retries (HTTP 502: Server Error).\n  This is a GitHub API error, not a test failure; this shard will run its tests.\n  ```\n  This check only saves GPU time on runs that are already failing, so not knowing should mean \"run the tests\". `pr-test-finish` still enforces test results.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Added a case to `action.test.cjs`: a jobs-list 502 after retries warns and doesn't fail the shard.\n- `node --test .github/actions/check-pr-test-health/action.test.cjs` with Node 20: 6/6 pass.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39869052486](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39869052486)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39869052487](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39869052487)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:heavy_minus_sign: **No AMD PR run found for this commit**.<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
